{
  "task.5E0907252C228A2D.title": "&aUranium Pellet&r or &aPlutonium Pellet&r",
  "quest.033F3D2427ED6F40.quest_desc": [
    "Turns the machine off with redstone and gives a comparator reading.",
  ],
  "quest.7791DA964DA2A80D.quest_desc": [
    "Put any item into the controller to use it as a particle. A straight &aGuide Ring&r goes right behind the controller, facing sideways.",
    "",
    "Guide Rings set the route. Right-click one to add a 45 degree turn, and leave gaps no wider than the particle's speed allows. &2Linear Motors&r add speed on every pass, for power.",
  ],
  "quest.030F1F8A4B0C1EBF.quest_desc": [
    "&aHeat Vents&r pull heat from the hottest component next to them and vent it. The hotter that neighbor, the more they remove.",
    "",
    "&aHeat Pipes&r take heat from fuel rods and spread it across the vents around them, so one rod can share several vents.",
  ],
  "quest.4A5FD3641E0A566E.quest_desc": [
    "&aReactor Energy Ports&r go on the outer walls and send out up to 75,000 RF/t each in this pack.",
    "",
    "A &aReactor Redstone Port&r stops new fuel from going in, though pellets already burning finish first. With a comparator it reports energy, active rods or temperature; right-click to cycle.",
  ],
  "quest.033F3D2427ED6F40.title": "&fRedstone Control Unit",
  "quest.39EFBD54020011EF.title": "&6Turbofuel",
  "quest.6CE7FB30455E939E.quest_desc": [
    "Past tier 3 the addons move to the &dFabricator&r, and each band waits on a milestone.",
    "",
    "- &bTiers 4 and 5&r: build an Atomic Forge first. They use &2Adamantite Plates&r.",
    "- &bTiers 6 and 7&r: kill the Wither first. They use &aAeternium Plates&r.",
    "- &bTiers 8 and 9&r: free the End first. They use &2Aurichalcum Plates&r.",
    "",
    "Every step takes the tier below it plus two regular addons of the same kind.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: carrying an Atomic Forge, a Super AI Chip, a Heisenberg Compensator or an Advanced Computing Engine also opens the first band.",
  ],
  "quest.7A26B0FFC0BCA275.quest_desc": [
    "Turns a laser into a turret. One, two or three addons reach 4.5, 16.5 or 64.5 blocks.",
  ],
  "quest.539458FB0A93BE4B.title": "&bFrame Placer",
  "quest.1770A460E1FD7CC8.quest_desc": [
    "A straight run of motors can fire a particle at something, but rings are the efficient way to build speed.",
    "",
    "Slow particles need guide rings close together, so start in a small ring and use redstone switches to move a particle out into a bigger one as it speeds up.",
    "",
    "The fastest particles cannot take tight turns. Leave long straights before each 90 degree corner.",
  ],
  "quest.091B8E814908DEDF.title": "&dAtomic Forge",
  "quest.0A6E103A6945D11E.quest_desc": [
    "Oritech's machines are made of alloys, and the &aFoundry&r is where they come from.",
    "",
    "It needs three cores. Place the Foundry first, right-click it to see where the cores go, then right-click again once they are in place.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: In this pack the Foundry is made with gold instead of electrum, so it can come before any alloy.",
  ],
  "quest.692DC36FB22620DB.quest_desc": [
    "A generator with a &aSteam Boiler Addon&r stops making RF and boils water instead: 0.2 mB of steam each tick for every RF/t it would have made.",
    "",
    "A Fuel Generator makes 1,638 mB of steam a tick that way. Pipe water into the addon block and steam out of it; both tanks hold 128 buckets.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "In this pack a &eColossal Reactors&r turbine makes 9 RF per mB of steam before coils and blades, so one boiler-fitted Fuel Generator feeding a turbine gives about 14,700 RF/t before coils, and up to about 47,000 RF/t with the best coils and blades. Each blade takes up to 48 mB a tick, so it needs at least 35 blades.",
    "",
    "Set a Turbine Resource Port to Insert to take the steam in.",
  ],
  "quest.107B36DF506002D4.quest_subtitle": "The last word in power",
  "quest.0C9CD2D8F10D750F.quest_desc": [
    "Aim a powered laser at an &2Amethyst Cluster&r and it harvests &aFluxite&r instead of amethyst. Aim it at Budding Amethyst and the clusters grow almost every tick.",
    "",
    "Fluxite, a Processing Unit and a Platinum Ingot make a &aFlux Gate&r in the Assembler, the part every late machine asks for.",
    "",
    "Fluxite Bees from &eProductive Bees&r are another source.",
  ],
  "quest.030F1F8A4B0C1EBF.title": "&cHeat Vents and Pipes",
  "quest.0BAF0C06F01C4E80.title": "&fAcceptor Addon",
  "quest.738AAB7C13A1C2CF.quest_desc": [
    "Banks 240 ticks of 8x speed per addon. Once spent, the machine runs slightly slower until the bank refills.",
  ],
  "quest.727FC1D9337AAD8C.quest_desc": [
    "A laser aimed at any block that stores energy pushes 128 RF into it every tick, ignoring the block's input limit.",
    "",
    "Aim several lasers at the same block and their power adds up. That is how the Atomic Forge, which takes no cables, gets fed. One Prometheum Ingot costs 245,760 RF, about 96 seconds from one laser or 24 from four.",
    "",
    "The Arcane Catalyst and the Bedrock Extractor are powered the same way.",
  ],
  "quest.33E4C81B762892B2.title": "&eOritech",
  "quest.7F70D7907F8EBA66.quest_desc": [
    "Drone Ports normally only deliver within one dimension.",
    "",
    "Put a &aCross-Dimensional Addon&r on the sending Drone Port. Save the receiving port with an &2Advanced Target Designator&r, which remembers the dimension as well as the position, then use it on the sending port. Its drones then deliver to the other dimension whenever the port holds items.",
    "",
    "The addon is made in the Fabricator once you have killed the Wither.",
  ],
  "quest.68760266CAAF9F8C.title": "&fSilk Touch Addon",
  "quest.535666E7CDE3BD43.title": "&fSynergy Matrix",
  "quest.1582865EA8A8091B.quest_desc": [
    "Addon faces run out long before you run out of ideas. &eOritech Things&r packs several addons into one face.",
    "",
    "Make a &aTier 2 Addon&r of any kind. Tier 2 does the work of two regular addons of its kind, and every tier above adds one more, up to tier 9. Speed, efficiency, extra processing chambers and stored energy all follow that rule. Capacitor and Acceptor transfer rates grow more slowly.",
    "",
    "Tier 2 is crafted at a crafting table and tier 3 in the &2Assembler&r, from the tier below it and two more regular addons.",
  ],
  "quest.7791DA964DA2A80D.title": "&fAccelerator Setup",
  "quest.2765AC7C3E0350FE.title": "&9Spawning Mobs",
  "quest.06DA083C1726EE4C.title": "&fQuarry Addon",
  "task.200DC63D1223B179.title": "Any &aReactor Rod&r",
  "quest.68760266CAAF9F8C.quest_desc": [
    "Silk touch for lasers and Destroyers. Replaces Yield.",
  ],
  "quest.1B20BEE2BE4476A7.quest_desc": [
    "The &aCybernetic Augmentation Center&r installs implants straight into your body. There are 29 of them, from flight and armor to reach and an item magnet.",
    "",
    "It needs ten cores. Walk into the finished machine to open its interface, research an augment, then install it with the listed energy and items.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\", \"Hold \", {\"keybind\": \"key.oritech.augment_screen\", \"color\": \"yellow\", \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Default: G\"}}, \", hover over an augment and release to toggle it.\"]",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: The center stores every researched blueprint. Break it and the research is gone, though installed augments can be scanned back in with the Import button.",
  ],
  "quest.2A0BE00CE5037684.quest_desc": [
    "Two blocks make a Particle Accelerator easier to run.",
    "",
    "The &aAccelerator Magnetic Field&r helps particles through tight turns. Place it inside the ring, then link it with an &2Advanced Target Designator&r saved on the accelerator. Only one field per accelerator counts.",
    "",
    "The &aParticle Accelerator Speed Sensor&r gives a redstone signal once particles pass a speed you set, and links the same way. Accelerator Motors also take Speed and Efficiency addons placed underneath them.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: In this version the Magnetic Field does not help particles through turns, and the Speed Sensor gives no signal. This is a bug in the mod, so hold off on building them until an update fixes it.",
  ],
  "quest.7F186F5B5630DB4A.quest_desc": [
    "The &aFuel Generator&r is Oritech's big burner: 8,192 RF/t in this pack, from any fuel in the oil family.",
    "",
    "It needs 17 cores. JEI lists every fluid it accepts and how long each one lasts.",
    "",
    "On its own it is a fine generator. With a Steam Boiler Addon it becomes the front half of something much bigger.",
  ],
  "task.765414790D7CA99B.title": "&aRaw Nickel&r",
  "quest.2ECAD5F752E445F1.title": "{\"text\": \"Prometheum\", \"color\": \"#FCD205\"}",
  "quest.06DA083C1726EE4C.quest_desc": [
    "Widens a laser's beam by one block, or digs a Destroyer eight times deeper.",
  ],
  "quest.77C53FD36F7747EA.title": "&dTachyons",
  "quest.7F186F5B5630DB4A.title": "&cFuel Generator",
  "quest.22B83D03C6C3E61E.quest_desc": [
    "Works 50% faster, but each operation uses 20% more energy.",
  ],
  "quest.539458FB0A93BE4B.quest_desc": [
    "Building a frame for a Destroyer one block at a time gets old.",
    "",
    "Sneak + Right-click a frame machine with a &aFrame Placer&r, set the frame size, and it builds the frame from the frame blocks you carry.",
  ],
  "quest.39BC89942A5CA7E1.title": "&fEfficiency Addon",
  "quest.036C11AC70835846.quest_desc": [
    "The &aEnderic Laser&r sends power, mines and grows crystals, all from up to 128 blocks away.",
    "",
    "Use the &2Target Designator&r on a block to store it, then on the laser to aim. The beam passes through glass.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: If the target is removed while the laser runs, it mines its way along that line instead.",
  ],
  "quest.091B8E814908DEDF.quest_subtitle": "Prometheum, uranium and the endgame chips",
  "quest.535666E7CDE3BD43.quest_desc": [
    "Works 75% faster for only 10% more energy per operation.",
  ],
  "quest.0E0B4F549B42AF63.title": "&aReactor Rods",
  "quest.77C53FD36F7747EA.quest_desc": [
    "Fast collisions throw off &dtachyons&r in random directions, and the harder the hit, the more energy they carry and the further they fly.",
    "",
    "&aTachyon Absorbers&r catch them as RF. Each holds 1,000,000 RF and sends it out of its back face only.",
    "",
    "Ring the collision point with absorbers to catch the spray. For big collisions, set them further back so the tachyons spread over several.",
  ],
  "quest.143E07D2565798AB.title": "&bMachine Cores",
  "quest.10AD11B1A8306AC9.title": "&6The Refinery",
  "quest.6697F832067F1A9C.title": "&dEnderic Railgun",
  "quest.0A92084D7043133A.quest_desc": [
    "&aAddons&r sit on specific faces of a machine and change how it works. The machine's addon screen shows which faces take them.",
    "",
    "A &aMachine Addon Extender&r adds more faces. A machine can use as many extenders as its core quality, so better cores mean more addons.",
    "",
    "In this pack addon effects stack by adding together.",
  ],
  "quest.67D437F7F6220BB5.quest_desc": [
    "No turbine yet? The &aSteam Engine&r burns the same steam.",
    "",
    "It runs best with its tank about 69% full, gives back 90% of the steam as water, and chains up to 20 engines on each side into one master.",
    "",
    "At its best it makes about 29 RF per mB, so once a Colossal Reactors turbine is running, the steam is worth far more there.",
  ],
  "quest.7A26B0FFC0BCA275.title": "&fHunter Addon",
  "quest.2C0C63951FDED180.title": "&dParticle Accelerator",
  "quest.2A0BE00CE5037684.title": "&dAccelerator Upgrades",
  "quest.3AC24F0B92156F55.quest_desc": [
    "Most of the parts on the way to the endgame are made in the &aAssembler&r.",
    "",
    "It takes up to four inputs and keeps crafting while it has power, ingredients and room in its output. Three cores.",
    "",
    "Some components also have a hand recipe, but it costs more materials than the Assembler version.",
  ],
  "quest.45B55DF3A6745291.title": "&6Exo Jetpack",
  "quest.24CE908ED60FD514.quest_desc": [
    "The &aPulverizer&r needs no cores at all, which makes it the first real machine.",
    "",
    "It crushes ores into dust and turns plants into &2Biomass&r for the Bio Generator.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: In this pack the Pulverizer makes &2Enderic Compound&r from Ender Dust, 8 at a time, instead of from Ender Pearls. The Fragment Forge still turns one pearl into 12.",
  ],
  "task.0AE9E3C1553154B6.title": "Any &aMachine Core&r",
  "quest.10AD11B1A8306AC9.quest_desc": [
    "Crude oil is weak fuel. The &aRefinery&r splits it into something much better.",
    "",
    "On its own it splits Crude Oil into Heavy Oil, Naphtha and Sulfuric Acid. Add &2Clay Catalyst Beads&r and it makes Diesel straight from the oil.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Heavy Oil with Sand refines into Diesel too, so nothing from the first split is wasted.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: A Refinery on its own only puts out its first fluid. Stack &aRefinery Chamber Modules&r on top, up to two, to get the second and third outputs.",
  ],
  "quest.2AB2C3ABF3F0EC71.title": "&6The Ninth Tier",
  "quest.45B2C8BD2ACBA46D.title": "&fDesigning Your Reactor",
  "quest.0F3EDB9AE592016B.title": "&fCapacitor Addon",
  "quest.39EFBD54020011EF.quest_desc": [
    "Diesel is good. &aTurbofuel&r is better.",
    "",
    "In a Centrifuge with a Fluid Addon, 1,000 mB of Diesel and one &2Fluxite&r make 1,000 mB of Turbofuel.",
    "",
    "In the Fuel Generator, Crude Oil is worth 1,638 RF per mB, Diesel 6,554 and Turbofuel 26,214. The output per tick is the same; the better fuel just lasts longer.",
  ],
  "quest.0A92084D7043133A.title": "&bMachine Customization",
  "quest.2D48306B1E2F72B8.title": "&6Where Oil Comes From",
  "quest.39BC89942A5CA7E1.quest_desc": [
    "Each operation uses about 17% less energy.",
  ],
  "quest.50B7CA94F8BB6F58.quest_desc": [
    "The &aCentrifuge&r takes one core and separates items, turning clumps into gems and Redstone into a little uranium dust.",
    "",
    "Fit a &aFluid Addon&r and it handles fluids too. Its tank holds 64 buckets in this pack, and later it is the machine that turns Diesel into Turbofuel.",
  ],
  "quest.0E0B4F549B42AF63.quest_desc": [
    "&aFuel Rods&r run from a &2Fuel Port&r on the ceiling all the way to the floor, and burn the pellets put into that port.",
    "",
    "A single rod makes 1 internal pulse, a double 4 and a quad 12. Rods next to each other pulse each other too, so they make more energy and more heat.",
    "",
    "&2Neutron Reflectors&r bounce pulses back into a rod, which counts like having another rod beside it.",
  ],
  "quest.2DCC43735EC5F60F.title": "&aFirst Power",
  "quest.2ECAD5F752E445F1.quest_desc": [
    "&aPrometheum&r comes only from the Atomic Forge, and it is the most expensive thing the forge makes.",
    "",
    "It makes the &2Ultimate Machine Core&r and the Prometheum tools. The Prometheum Battleaxe hits for 10.5 in this pack and fells whole trees when you sneak.",
  ],
  "quest.7F186F5B5630DB4A.quest_subtitle": "8,192 RF/t from any oil",
  "quest.2AB2C3ABF3F0EC71.quest_desc": [
    "A tier 9 addon is nine regular addons in a single face.",
    "",
    "Make one. On top of its &2Aurichalcum Plates&r it needs an &aUltimate Machine Core&r.",
  ],
  "quest.17B369A4BF64EE98.title": "&6Beyond the Limit",
  "quest.6CE7FB30455E939E.title": "&bFabricated Tiers",
  "quest.2DCC43735EC5F60F.quest_desc": [
    "Oritech machines run on RF, and the first source is simple.",
    "",
    "Craft a &aBasic Generator&r. It burns any furnace fuel at 64 RF/t, so a stack of coal keeps the early machines going.",
    "",
    "The &2Bio Generator&r is the next step. It needs one core, makes 256 RF/t, and gets 128,000 RF from every piece of &aBiomass&r the Pulverizer makes.",
  ],
  "quest.107B36DF506002D4.title": "&5Black Hole",
  "quest.0A6E103A6945D11E.title": "&aThe Foundry",
  "quest.17B369A4BF64EE98.quest_desc": [
    "An &aArcane Catalyst&r can push an enchantment past its normal maximum.",
    "",
    "Put in an Enchanted Book at that enchantment's max level, and the item. Every second the item gains a level. Past the normal max the book is used up and each level costs more souls, but there is no cap.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A catalyst holds 50 souls to start. RF raises that. Each extra soul of room needs a steady 20 RF/t, and an Enderic Laser aimed at the catalyst is the easy way to supply it.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: If a catalyst holds more souls than its room for three seconds, it explodes.",
  ],
  "quest.2D48306B1E2F72B8.quest_desc": [
    "Every oil in this pack is the same fluid as Oritech's Crude Oil, so it all goes into the Refinery and the Fuel Generator.",
    "",
    "- &2Oil springs&r: Oritech's oil generates across the Overworld, with extra near desert pyramids.",
    "- &eNautec&r: a &2Lipophiles&r colony makes &aAlgal Lipid&r, and the Mixer turns 1 Lipid and 250 mB of Saltwater into 1,000 mB of oil.",
    "- &eProductive Bees&r: the &2Oily Bee&r, caught by bee fishing in deep ocean, makes combs that centrifuge into 50 mB of oil.",
  ],
  "quest.67D437F7F6220BB5.title": "&7Steam Engine",
  "quest.456030ECDFA9CE3B.quest_desc": [
    "&aHeat Absorbers&r remove 16 heat a tick from every neighbor at once, so they work best boxed in by hot parts.",
    "",
    "They need ice, packed ice or blue ice, fed through a &aCoolant Port&r on the outer ceiling above the absorber stack. The ice used stays the same however many sides are cooled.",
  ],
  "quest.107B36DF506002D4.quest_desc": [
    "Send a particle off the end of its path faster than 15,000 and into a portal block, and it tears open a &5Black Hole&r.",
    "",
    "Two Fire Charges colliding above 5,000 make a nether portal, and two Ender Pearls above 15,000 make an end portal, so the accelerator can build its own target.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Black Hole eats blocks within 16 blocks and kills anything that touches it. Each block it eats fires up to five tachyon rays, and every ray caught by an absorber gives 50,000 RF.",
    "",
    "Feed it cobblestone from a block placer and it becomes a power plant.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&cWarning&r: Anything it can reach, it eats. In this pack it can be mined with the right tool and drops itself, so you can move it.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"The Black Hole\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,oritech:guide,oritech:black_hole_generator.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Black Hole guide page\"}}, \" shows a working generator.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.036C11AC70835846.title": "&dThe Power Of The End",
  "quest.13DFA7B0975971B7.title": "&eOritech Enchanting",
  "quest.143E07D2565798AB.quest_desc": [
    "Every multiblock lists how many &aMachine Cores&r it needs in its tooltip. Place the controller, then right-click it with cores in hand to fill the marked spots.",
    "",
    "Make a stack of the first or second tier. Any tier fits any machine, so cheap cores are fine for now.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "There are seven tiers. A machine's quality is the average level of its cores, and it decides how many &2Addon Extenders&r the machine can use. Better cores do not make a machine faster on their own.",
  ],
  "quest.3AC24F0B92156F55.title": "&dThe Assembler",
  "quest.3D9FFFF325533514.quest_desc": [
    "Fortune for lasers and Destroyers, up to three. Doubles the Fragment Forge's byproducts.",
  ],
  "quest.2765AC7C3E0350FE.quest_desc": [
    "A &aSpawner Controller&r copies the first mob that walks over it, then spawns more into a box of &2Spawner Cages&r underneath, sized to the mob.",
    "",
    "Each spawn costs souls, the square root of the mob's health. Right-click the controller to see the cage size and its state.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: Ender Dragons, Ice and Fire creatures and the pack's protected mobs cannot be copied.",
  ],
  "quest.727FC1D9337AAD8C.title": "&dLaser Array",
  "quest.0F3EDB9AE592016B.quest_desc": [
    "Adds 2,000,000 RF of storage and 2,000 RF/t of input.",
  ],
  "quest.3F75F781DE5123F4.title": "&dNuclear Reactor",
  "quest.7F70D7907F8EBA66.title": "&bAcross Dimensions",
  "quest.7F7AF4C047AF4EFE.title": "&bEfficient Speed",
  "quest.1E649B7D09AB54F5.quest_desc": [
    "Ore processing gets serious with the &aFragment Forge&r.",
    "",
    "It breaks ore down into clumps plus byproducts, and the &2Centrifuge&r turns the clumps into gems. It needs seven cores and has five addon slots.",
    "",
    "A &2Yield Addon&r on the Fragment Forge doubles its byproducts.",
  ],
  "quest.2588279A071E5A6B.title": "&9Collecting Souls",
  "quest.778A876616D4638E.title": "&fParticle Sensor",
  "quest.61BF4B18F713FECD.title": "&fAuxiliary Processing Chamber",
  "quest.50B7CA94F8BB6F58.title": "&aSpin To Win",
  "quest.692DC36FB22620DB.title": "&bFull Steam Ahead",
  "quest.1B20BEE2BE4476A7.title": "&dCybernetic Augmentation Center",
  "quest.4A5FD3641E0A566E.title": "&2Energy and Redstone Ports",
  "quest.24CE908ED60FD514.title": "&aIt's Crushing Time",
  "quest.2588279A071E5A6B.quest_desc": [
    "Oritech's arcane machines run on &bSouls&r.",
    "",
    "Any living thing that dies within 23 blocks of a block that collects souls sends its soul there. Harvested &2Soul Flowers&r, grown on soul soil, release one too.",
    "",
    "Arcane Catalysts and Spawner Controllers both collect them, and a soul always flies to the closest one with room.",
  ],
  "quest.456030ECDFA9CE3B.title": "&bHeat Absorbers",
  "quest.778A876616D4638E.quest_desc": [
    "A curved Guide Ring with a redstone signal becomes a switch and sends particles straight on.",
    "",
    "The &aParticle Accelerator Sensor&r reads a particle's speed, and a comparator turns it into a signal from 0 up to 15,000 speed at the top level.",
    "",
    "A particle that is too fast for a turn, or finds no next ring, leaves the path and flies off into the world.",
  ],
  "quest.091B8E814908DEDF.quest_desc": [
    "The &aAtomic Forge&r makes what nothing else can: Silicon Wafers, Uranium Gems, the AI chips and Prometheum.",
    "",
    "It needs eight cores and takes no cables at all. Every craft is paid for by Enderic Lasers aimed at it, 1,024 RF per tick of recipe time.",
    "",
    "Point more lasers at it to craft faster.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: building one also opens tier 4 and 5 addons in the Fabricator.",
  ],
  "quest.738AAB7C13A1C2CF.title": "&fBurst Addon",
  "quest.3D9FFFF325533514.title": "&fYield Addon",
  "quest.61BF4B18F713FECD.quest_desc": [
    "Runs one extra recipe at the same time, for 50% more energy.",
  ],
  "quest.45B2C8BD2ACBA46D.quest_desc": [
    "A reactor is a rectangular box of &aReactor Walls&r, at most 16 blocks in each direction, with the control panel and energy ports set into the walls.",
    "",
    "The inside must be the same on every layer. A 3x3x3 works, but 5x5x5 leaves room to cool it.",
    "",
    "Double and quad rods get more energy from each pellet but are much harder to cool.",
  ],
  "quest.22B83D03C6C3E61E.title": "&fSpeed Addon",
  "quest.13DFA7B0975971B7.quest_desc": [
    "The &aStabilized Enchanter&r adds the enchantment you choose, one level at a time, up to its normal maximum.",
    "",
    "It needs &aArcane Catalysts&r holding souls within 16 blocks, one for each point of the enchantment's anvil cost plus its level. Each step takes 512 RF and one soul.",
    "",
    "The catalysts can do far more than this on their own.",
  ],
  "quest.7F7AF4C047AF4EFE.quest_desc": [
    "Speed addons make a machine faster and hungrier. The &aEfficient Speed Addon&r keeps the speed and drops the extra power cost.",
    "",
    "Each one joins a Speed and an Efficiency addon of the same tier in the Fabricator, one band later than its parts. Tiers 2 and 3 open after the Atomic Forge, 4 and 5 after the Wither, and 6 to 9 after the End.",
  ],
  "quest.0C9CD2D8F10D750F.title": "&cFlux Gate",
  "quest.1E649B7D09AB54F5.title": "&aFragment Forge",
  "quest.0BAF0C06F01C4E80.quest_desc": [
    "Adds 500,000 RF and 5,000 RF/t of input, and the addon block itself takes cables.",
  ],
  "quest.3F75F781DE5123F4.quest_desc": [
    "The &aNuclear Reactor Control Panel&r runs a reactor you design yourself, cell by cell.",
    "",
    "Fuel starts in the Atomic Forge, which turns raw uranium into Uranium Gems. The Assembler then presses the gems into Uranium Pellets.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "This pack's reactors are smaller but stronger. They can be at most 16 blocks across, store 500,000,000 RF, and send 75,000 RF/t out of each energy port.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: A rod held above 4,000 heat for too long melts down, and the explosion grows with the reactor.",
  ],
  "quest.1770A460E1FD7CC8.title": "&fAccelerator Designs",
  "quest.33E4C81B762892B2.quest_desc": [
    "&eOritech&r builds everything as a multiblock. Each machine is one controller with a few &2Machine Cores&r around it, and addons on its sides make it faster, cheaper or smarter.",
    "",
    "Smelt some &aNickel Ingots&r. Nickel goes into almost every Oritech machine, from the first core to the reactor.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: Oritech's own ores do not generate in this pack. Nickel, uranium and platinum all come from the pack's own ore generation, with platinum in the Overworld, the Nether and the End.",
  ],
  "quest.1582865EA8A8091B.title": "&bTiered Addons",
  "quest.6697F832067F1A9C.quest_desc": [
    "The &aEnderic Railgun&r is a laser you carry. It holds 5,000,000 RF and fires a beam that damages anything in its path or mines the block it hits.",
    "",
    "Its other fire mode is an explosive shot. Sneak + Right-click switches between mining and combat.",
    "",
    "Aimed at a block that stores energy, the beam charges it instead of breaking it.",
  ],
  "quest.2C0C63951FDED180.quest_desc": [
    "The &aParticle Accelerator&r smashes items together to make new ones. Coal dust becomes diamonds, Fluxite and Energite become Overcharged Crystals, and the fastest collisions make Nether Stars.",
    "",
    "Every collision has a minimum energy, the two particles' speeds added together, and JEI lists what each one makes.",
    "",
    "Collisions need two controllers firing into the same path.",
  ],
  "quest.45B55DF3A6745291.quest_desc": [
    "The &aExo Jetpack&r gives you creative flight.",
    "",
    "Wear it in your chest slot while it holds more than 10,000 RF and you can fly freely once you are in the air. Landing or going underwater turns flight off until you are airborne again, and so does running the charge down.",
    "",
    "It is made in the Fabricator once you have freed the End, and it needs &2Aurichalcum Plates&r.",
  ],
}